sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Browser
    participant App as Flask App
    participant Google
    participant DB as Database

    User->>Browser: Open login page
    Browser->>App: GET /login
    App-->>Browser: Render login page
    alt Local login
        Browser->>App: POST credentials
        App->>DB: Validate active user
        DB-->>App: User record
        App-->>Browser: Create session and redirect
    else Google OAuth
        Browser->>Google: OAuth authorization
        Google-->>App: Callback with user profile
        App->>DB: Find user or create access request
        App-->>Browser: Login or pending approval
    end

